{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-of-science-grad","title":"科学哲学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad","introMarkdown":"# 科学哲学 简介\n\n科学哲学追问科学知识的本质、科学方法的合理性以及科学理论变迁的内在逻辑。对于研究生而言，理解科学哲学不仅是哲学训练的一部分，更能帮助任何学科的研究者反思自身研究的认识论预设和方法论基础。\n\n本课程从科学哲学的经典问题出发，经由方法论核心争论和当代前沿论争，最终延伸到具体科学领域的哲学反思，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**科学哲学基础**围绕三个经典议题展开：划界问题探讨科学与非科学的区分标准，科学实在论辩论理论实体的本体论地位，范式转换理论揭示科学革命的结构特征。这些问题构成了科学哲学的基本概念地图。\n\n第二章**科学方法论**深入分析科学推理的核心形式。归纳与演绎推理的关系、波普尔证伪主义的贡献与局限、以及拉卡托斯研究纲领方法论的综合尝试，呈现了哲学家对科学方法合理性的持续探索。\n\n第三章**当代科学哲学论争**转向二十世纪后半叶至今的前沿讨论。社会建构主义挑战了科学知识的客观性假设，女性主义认识论提出了立场的认识论价值，科学中的价值介入问题则模糊了事实与价值的传统界限。\n\n第四章**科学哲学应用**将抽象的哲学分析运用到物理学、生物学和社会科学三个具体领域。每个领域都有独特的本体论困惑和方法论挑战，具体案例有助于学习者看到科学哲学议题的现实意义。\n\n建议学习者按照章节顺序推进，在阅读理论讨论时结合自己学科背景中的具体案例进行思考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"科学哲学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"demarcation-problem","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 划界问题","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/foundations/demarcation-problem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-realism","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 科学实在论","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/foundations/scientific-realism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"paradigm-shifts","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 范式转换","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/foundations/paradigm-shifts"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"methodology","title":"科学方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"induction-deduction","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 归纳与演绎","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/methodology/induction-deduction"},{"seq":2,"slug":"falsificationism","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 证伪主义","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/methodology/falsificationism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"research-programs","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 研究纲领","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/methodology/research-programs"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-debates","title":"当代科学哲学论争","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/contemporary-debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-constructionism","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 社会建构主义","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/contemporary-debates/social-constructionism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"feminist-epistemology","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 女性主义认识论","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/contemporary-debates/feminist-epistemology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"values-in-science","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 科学中的价值","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/contemporary-debates/values-in-science"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"科学哲学应用","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-of-physics","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 物理学哲学","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/applications/philosophy-of-physics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"philosophy-of-biology","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 生物学哲学","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/applications/philosophy-of-biology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"philosophy-of-social-science","title":"研究生 科学哲学 — 社会科学哲学","url":"/education/graduate/philosophy/philosophy-of-science-grad/applications/philosophy-of-social-science"}]}]}